<title>USA: IPO FILING - Aehr Test Systems.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Aehr Test Systems.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Aehr Test Systems</p>
<p>Stock symbol			AEHR.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9-$11/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.2 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  1.1 million Shrs outstanding after ipo    6,495,522</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		Oppenheimer &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  495,000 shrs Business: Based in Mountain View, Calif., Aehr develops, manufactures and sells systems which are designed to reduce the cost of testing DRAMS and other memory devices.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Net proceeds will be used for repayment of debt, capital expenditures, and general corporate purposes, including working capital and potential acquisitions.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended May 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Net sales	     $33,234	    $23,257</p>
<p>   - Net Income (loss)    $1,400	    ($1,987)</p>
